											<Extension>
												<PvRename Name="ExposureMode"/>
											</Extension>
											<ToolTip>Automatic exposure mode. Off: automatic mode is off. Once: auto-exposure occurs until target is achieved, then ExposureAuto returns to Off. Continuous: auto-exposure always runs.</ToolTip>
											<Description>Automatic exposure mode. Off: automatic mode is off. Once: auto-exposure occurs until target is achieved, then ExposureAuto returns to Off. Continuous: auto-exposure always runs.</Description>
											<Streamable>Yes</Streamable>
